# AutoFlow AI - backend environment configuration (example)
#
# Copy to `backend/.env` and fill in real values. NEVER commit the real
# `.env` or real API keys. Only placeholders live in this file.
#
# The AI Planner resolves the default LLM provider from the FIRST key
# present in this list (preference order: openai, anthropic, gemini,
# openrouter). With no key configured the planner runs its deterministic
# pipeline and reports mode=deterministic - it never pretends an LLM
# generated the plan.

# --- Database -----------------------------------------------------------
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://autoflow:autoflow_secret_dev@localhost:5433/autoflow
# REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6380/0

# --- LLM providers (placeholders - fill with real keys) -----------------
